# Stand-in org.kde.plasma.workspace.dbus module for the offscreen lifecycle (test use only):
# found before the system module on the harness's import path, so nothing reaches a bus. It is
# kept out of the shared stubs/, which every offscreen suite reads: the snap script and the
# switcher load the system module through their copies of FusionTablet, which uses more of it
# than the stand-in has.
module org.kde.plasma.workspace.dbus
singleton SessionBus 1.0 SessionBus.qml
